    <othernotes>Key Traits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;-100% committed to the duties of a knight. Tries hard to live up to the high expectations set for her&lt;br&gt;-Skilled warrior; one of the best sword users in Mondstadt, if not the best&lt;br&gt;-Named the Dandelion Knight (AKA Lionfang Knight) at 15, a prestigious title only given to the best&lt;br&gt;-Admired by citizens, universally considered reliable&lt;br&gt;-Bad at delegating tasks; feels compelled to do everything herself, including finding lost cats&lt;br&gt;-Follows a very strict schedule, partitioned down to the minute&lt;br&gt;-Stays up late finishing her work&lt;br&gt;-Secretly loves romance novels; desires romance for herself&lt;br&gt;-Family motto is "For Mondstadt, as always" and lives up to it&lt;br&gt;-accustomed to spartan lifestyle; does not expect gifts or favours from others&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Other Info&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;-Gunnhildr clan is a very old knightly family, dating back to the time of Decarabian (who they opposed)&lt;br&gt;-Jean drinks a lot of coffee. Mentioned to go through her monthly quota in a few days&lt;br&gt;-Had a very packed and detailed training schedule as a child, as directed by her mother&lt;br&gt;-Personal hero is Vanessa, the founder of the Knights of Favonius and the first Dandelion Knight&lt;br&gt;-Favourite place is the Great Tree at Windrise. Used to visit on her birthday with her mom instead of a party and gifts&lt;br&gt;-Knows that Venti is Barbatos. In Mondstadt, only Diluc also knows this.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Interpersonal&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;-Older sister to Barbara. Wants to reconnect with her but doesn't know how.&lt;br&gt;-Parents separated when she was young. She went with her mother, and Barbara with their father.&lt;br&gt;-Her mother, Frederica Gunnhildr, is a Favonius commander off on Varka's expedition to the far north. She sent Jean a fine sword she found for her birthday&lt;br&gt;-Goes on runs with Amber&lt;br&gt;-Has breakfast with Lisa&lt;br&gt;-Refers to Diluc as her senior despite him having left the Knights years ago&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Misc&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;-Has a pet tortoise&lt;br&gt;-Favourite food is pizza from Cat's Tail. Her special dish is called Invigorating Pizza&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Touchstones&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;-Work and being busy&lt;br&gt;-Scheduling&lt;br&gt;-Productivity&lt;br&gt;-Knighthood&lt;br&gt;-Mondstadt&lt;br&gt;-Earnestness&lt;br&gt;-Stories about heroes</othernotes>
