        <line>There. Now, can we get on with the game?</line>
        <line>There. It… it is done.. Shall we move on, now?</line>
        <line>O-Ohkay.. I’ve… i’ve undressed… g-gimme my card now, p-please…</line>
        <line>Worry not, perhaps your next round will turn out more favorably</line>
        <line>We stand on equal footing now, as true warriors!</line>
        <line>At least it wasn’t me, though now I’d imagine neither you nor I are going to waver after a single loss.</line>
        <line>H-How disgraceful…  to remove so little when a fair maiden is so… unveiled… </line>
        <line>It seems we’re partners in exhibitionism… just… please don’t stare too much…</line>
        <line>W-What? But you… are you doing this in solace for me? Y-You didn’t need to do such a thing…</line>
        <line>Those look like Sucrose’s… does she not need them anymore?</line>
        <line>Did you save that for last as a reason? Is it precious to you, I wonder…</line>
        <line>Never underestimate a good belt. Especially when Klee is running around… </line>
        <line>Accessories truly bring together an outfit, don’t you agree?</line>
        <line>I wonder… where are our items stored when removed? We do them back at the end of the game, r-right?</line>
        <line>I… I’m quite sure what to say to removing small items such as that.</line>
        <line>I suppose everyone has to start somewhere…</line>
        <line>That must be precious to you. Worry not, I will ensure it returns to you at the end of a match.</line>
        <line>Dealer, stop shuffling the deck, I haven’t gotten my answer yet!</line>
        <line>Luck smiles on me, let’s keep going!</line>
        <line>Lord Barbatos, bless my cards…</line>
        <line>Well then, shall we keep going?</line>
        <line>On with the next round!</line>
        <line>Come to think of it, did we not create bracelets like that growing up, Barbara?</line>
        <line>A small start, but a start nonetheless.</line>
        <line>A good pair of gloves can really complete an outfit. Do you agree ~target~?</line>
        <line>A tad disappointing… w-what? I-I’m not hoping to see anything…</line>
        <line>… not much to say on such a small removal…</line>
        <line>I’ve sometimes wondered if I should add a hat to my ensemble… but I feel it might complicate my look…</line>
        <line>I own a beautiful necklace! It has a painting of me and my family… f-for obvious reasons, I left it at home…</line>
        <line>That’s so cute! …I wonder if Barbara still has that…</line>
        <line>To think, you’d do something as cute as that… how precious ~w~</line>
        <line>Um… next round, I suppose. </line>
        <line>Personally, I like my gloves a little… over the top, but I think all gloves are lovely.</line>
        <line>…S-Stop looking at me like that.</line>
        <line>Onto the next round.</line>
        <line>Nah, I’ve worn this outfit for so long, I shouldn’t change it up now, I suppose. </line>
        <line>I-I don’t want Mother or Father to see this place…</line>
        <line>O-Oh, don’t mind my musings. Just something me and my sister did when we were young…</line>
        <line>W-Why? A-Are you enjoying b-being exposed… d-dear me…</line>
        <line>W-What? Y-Your pants already? (T-That bulge… oh dear…)</line>
        <line>O-Oh my… you’re truly exposed right now… I… I shall avert my gaze, for you…</line>
        <line>D-Don’t worry… a-a lot of women don’t care about size…</line>
        <line>I-I see… you’re uh… w-well endowed…</line>
        <line>M-My word! (T-That’s wider than my arm! M-My word… s-stop thinking like that, J-Jean!)</line>
    </pendingLines>
